# Personal formula files stay on each person's machine, so nobody's experiment
# lands in someone else's checkout and no two people conflict over the same file.
# The shared library is the one everybody does commit.
formulas.*.json
!formulas.shared.json

# If you would rather keep personal files in the repo as a backup, delete the
# two lines above and commit them - they never affect anyone else's results,
# they are only loaded for whoever's profile name matches.
